    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay diverse DIGITAL GHOST \u2122 to unleash pinballs into the gigantic pachinko machine, to obtain a thrilling cascade of rewards, transforming each moment into a strategic gamble with explosive outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fluid, dynamic movement that allows you to dash through chaotic space, evade enemy attacks with precision, and chain together breathtaking maneuvers, creating a seamless blend of speed and style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentlessly maintain combos to increase your power, amplify the pulse and  fueling\u00a0 nonstop action as you conquer the world of P.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a mysterious cyber world where surreal visuals captivate your senses, pulling you into a hauntingly immersive experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333220/extras/5a69d5845c03877cd63f06baea7146f5.poster.avif?t=1742221873\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333220/extras/5a69d5845c03877cd63f06baea7146f5.webm?t=1742221873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333220/extras/5a69d5845c03877cd63f06baea7146f5.mp4?t=1742221873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
